    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόρ-εστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκορέννυμἰ</span>
